LiNeP-SL V0.1 is the current security-layer baseline for LiNeP communication.
Its version line is distinct from the separate LiNeP V0.1 and V0.2 protocol
baselines. The `linep-sl` Python distribution version does not rename the
LiNeP-SL V0.1 protocol baseline.

